  {
   "id": 296058,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Is the solution strategy used in solving the linear equation correct? If it is correct, show the final step (check the solution). If it is not correct, explain why.<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{8x + 7-\\left( {2x-9} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{22-\\left( {4x-4} \\right)}\\\\{8x + 7-2x-9}&amp;{ = }&amp;{22-4x-4}\\\\{6x-2}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18-4x}\\\\{6x-2 +{\\mathbf{ 4\\mathit{x}}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18-4x +{\\mathbf{ 4\\mathit{x}}}}\\\\{10x-2 +{\\mathbf{ 2}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18 +{\\mathbf{ 2}}}\\\\{10x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{20}\\\\{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{2}\\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{rcl}{8x + 7-\\left( {2x-9} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{22-\\left( {4x-4} \\right)}\\\\{8x + 7-2x-9}&amp;{ = }&amp;{22-4x-4}\\\\{6x-2}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18-4x}\\\\{6x-2 +{\\mathbf{ 4\\mathit{x}}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18-4x +{\\mathbf{4\\mathit{x}}}}\\\\{10x-2 +{\\mathbf{ 2}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18 +{\\mathbf{ 2}}}\\\\{10x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{20}\\\\{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{2}\\end{array}</span>",
   "answers": [],
