     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "This is not a correct solution strategy. The negative sign is not distributed correctly in the second line of the solution strategy. The second line should read <span data-math=\"8x + 7-2x + 9 = 22-4x + 4\">8x + 7-2x + 9 = 22-4x + 4</span>."
    }
